1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
{\an8}SKERRY POINT - EPISODE TWO

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,600
Twelve weeks.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,625
The log is still counting.

4
00:00:08,025 --> 00:00:11,275
- The Light held all night.
- It was warm all night.

5
00:00:11,675 --> 00:00:13,925
The Light has opinions about warmth.

6
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:15,575
Write it in the log.

7
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:18,538
<i>The tender's horn, two long notes.</i>

8
00:00:18,938 --> 00:00:20,138
That is the tender.

9
00:00:20,537 --> 00:00:22,412
The tender comes on the first.

10
00:00:22,812 --> 00:00:24,012
It is the ninth.

11
00:00:24,412 --> 00:00:26,225
Then it is a very late first.

12
00:00:26,625 --> 00:00:29,000
Flour, paraffin, and a letter for you.

13
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,150
<i>She does not open it.</i>

14
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,675
Ninety-seven stairs, they told me.

15
00:00:34,075 --> 00:00:35,275
Ninety-eight.

16
00:00:35,675 --> 00:00:37,487
You are counting the landing.

17
00:00:37,887 --> 00:00:40,075
- Who is that?
- The relief keeper.

18
00:00:40,475 --> 00:00:42,225
Nobody said a relief keeper.

19
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:43,875
The log will say it.

20
00:00:44,275 --> 00:00:46,587
I am Petar. I am here for the winter.

21
00:00:46,987 --> 00:00:49,050
Petar, how many gulls do you see?

22
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:51,762
<i>He counts. He actually counts.</i>

23
00:00:52,162 --> 00:00:53,362
Nine.

24
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:56,700
<i>Marta says nothing for a very long time.</i>

25
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,300
I like him.

26
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,575
You like anyone who says nine.

27
00:01:00,975 --> 00:01:02,850
Petar, the Light has opinions.

28
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:04,450
About what?

29
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:07,100
About the cold. Write it in the log.

30
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,000
{\an8}END OF EPISODE TWO

